- [Kelly] A little baby?

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:19.433
- Yes.
- So, okay.

00:00:19.433 --> 00:00:21.963
So what are you most excited
about a new little baby?

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:23.693
I love the smell.

00:00:23.693 --> 00:00:25.013
- Well, that's a hard
question because of the...

00:00:25.013 --> 00:00:25.846
