ask me that, I can't...

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:35.100
The first thing I do, I'm drawn to,

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:37.710
you know, speak about,
it's the lack of sleep.

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:39.960
- Yeah, no. Okay. That
was my next question.

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:41.310
