which he could leverage himself

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:54.840
you know, growing up.

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:56.275
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- It's important.

00:00:56.275 --> 00:00:57.108
(audience applauding)

00:00:57.108 --> 00:00:57.990
- I think it's cool too.

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:01.260
Like, I have friends that
have kids of all ages, right?

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:02.400
