00:01:55.885 --> 00:01:56.880
- You get experience life in your twenties

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:58.080
and really know what you're talking about.

00:01:58.080 --> 00:01:58.913
- You get to experience,
you get to travel.

00:01:58.913 --> 00:02:00.570
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- Yes. Absolutely.

00:02:00.570 --> 00:02:02.070
- [Kelly] Yeah. I'm excited
for y'all. That's exciting.

